  "extra": {
    "lab_profile": "stills/before-after",
    "lab_note": "## stills/before-after\n\nFormat / platform sets pixels (Custom uses Width x Height). Quality does not change size.\n\nTwo Klein 4B stills of one mug. SHOT BEFORE is the identity plate; AFTER Klein-edits from it. Prefixes `ez_before` and `ez_after`. Do not bypass BEFORE on a cold canvas.\n\nPrompt enhance is on by default (on-box Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507). After Queue, the Enhance node shows the prompt CLIP used. Turn Enhance off to pin the widget text.\n\nOccupancy: klein - stop Wan, LTX, podcast, music. One GB10 job.\n",
    "lab_description": "Klein 4B before/after still pair",
    "lab_app_mode": {
      "enabled": true,
      "default_view": "app",
      "frontend_min": "1.41.13",
      "lane": "produce",
      "occupancy": "klein",
      "enhance_off_identity": false,
      "handoff": []
    },
